WEBVTT

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:14.200
The mountains!
Aw, man, I'm so psyched!

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.030
The air is delicious.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.660
You can taste the air?

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.000
That's some sense of taste, Fumino.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.330
I meant more like the air is fresh...

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.250
Here we go again...

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:29.670
Ichinose Academy's famous three-day,
two-night study camp...

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:32.340
It's sad we had to come
all the way to the mountains

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.220
to study from morning until night.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:38.100
If it at least had mixed bathing...

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.510
Yeah, right...

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:43.350
Idiot! You have to let me dream
or I won't be able to take this!

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:44.690
Right, Yuiga?!

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.150
Mountain udo!

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:52.820
It's really good if you make
tempura out of it!

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:55.110
- Mountain udo?
- Nari is being his usual self.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.950
I'll take this home and...

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:59.410
Boys, what's going on over here?

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:04.370
Come on.
You need to get in line and walk.

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:06.080
Wait a second!

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.500
But my little sister loves that!

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.300
What are you talking about?

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.670
Mountain udo!

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.340
Is something wrong, Ri?

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:20.640
You've been staring at Yuiga...

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:24.930
Who has?

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.140
You have, Ri!

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:03.370
EPISODE 5:
A GENIUS IN THE FOREST
STRAYS FOR X

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.790
<i>Sheesh, Fumino has strange ideas.</i>

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:14.710
<i>Why would I observe Nariyuki
any more than is required?</i>

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.430
<i>N-No, I wasn't.</i>

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.350
<i>I didn't. He just happened
to be in my field of vision.</i>

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.100
Crap. I made a mistake.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:43.490
<i>If I give this to Yuiga,
groundless or not,</i>

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:47.370
<i>she'll suspect me of looking at him again!</i>

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.700
<i>What should I do?!</i>

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.960
Oh, Yuiga. Here.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.500
I brought a spare.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.550
I'd feel bad, Furuhashi...

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.210
No big deal.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.300
You're always helping me.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.970
Then I'll take you up on it.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:09.810
Oh no.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.890
Oops, sorry.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.860
Here, Nariyuki.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:20.730
Th-Thanks, Takemoto...

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.240
- S-Sorry!
- N-No, my bad.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:28.080
Sorry. I should've passed it
to you over the desk.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.410
VENDING MACHINES

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.550
<i>It must be because of a lack of calcium.</i>

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:44.130
<i>There's no other explanation
for this unusual nervousness.</i>

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:48.300
COLD MILK

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.300
A... A little more...

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.940
Hey, Ogata.
How's your studying coming along?

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:02.320
If there's anything you don't
understand, feel free to ask me...

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.290
It has nothing to do with you,
Yuiga!

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:17.670
Please leave me be!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:21.880
<i>I am your tutor, aren't I?!</i>

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:23.800
G-Goodbye!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.010
Where are you going?

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:26.630
We're not allowed to go outside!

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:28.890
I'm just stepping out for some fresh air!

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.510
I hear it's delicious.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:37.900
<i>What is this?
A sudden rebellious stage?</i>

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.740
<i>Why did I act like that?</i>

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.080
<i>B-But what should I do?</i>

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.630
<i>I don't know how to apologize
at a time like this.</i>

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.920
<i>I hate when I'm like this.</i>

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:07.420
<i>That's...</i>

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.850
<i>Wait a second!</i>

00:06:13.970 --> 00:06:16.310
<i>But my little sister loves that!</i>

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:24.820
Here, too.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:26.740
There, too.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:27.950
Over here, too.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.540
I picked a lot.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:48.630
I should probably be
getting back soon.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:02.100
Huh?
Which way did I come from again?

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.950
It's really coming down.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.070
It's true that weather
in the mountains changes easily.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.490
Nariyuki Yuiga.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.160
Have you seen Rizu Ogata?

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.790
Sekijo...
What about Ogata?

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:26.000
She isn't in the lecture room,
study room, or her own room.

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.130
It's inconvenient here
since they confiscated our cell phones.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:33.840
You really are in love with Ogata.

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.010
It's not like that!

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:44.770
I last saw Ogata after the lecture,
by the vending machines...

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.940
<i>I'm just stepping out for some fresh air!</i>

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.660
<i>Don't tell me she's still out there!</i>

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:08.710
She wouldn't be dumb enough
to walk around in this downpour.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:13.130
I'm the dumb one.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:16.140
I'll go back, take a bath, and then study.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:34.360
<i>No phone.
And I don't even know where I am.</i>

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:37.780
<i>I guess all I can do is sit tight
and wait for help to come.</i>

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:42.370
<i>It's raining really hard,
but if I can wait until tomorrow,</i>

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:46.080
<i>there's a 96% chance
or better someone will find me.</i>

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.460
<i>I've come to save you, Ogata!</i>

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:52.550
<i>Wh-Why would Yuiga come to mind?!</i>

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:55.840
<i>Prioritizing a possibility
with less than 4% chance of happening</i>

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.550
<i>and then simulating isn't logical!</i>

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.810
<i>Besides, I treated him like dirt.</i>

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:02.850
Ogata!

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:05.900
<i>Now I'm hearing things.</i>

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:26.870
You shouldn't sit like that.
I can probably see up your skirt.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.130
What are you doing here?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:38.640
This is one of those cards
from that first game we played, right?

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.600
It slid down to me in the rain.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:48.350
Figuring you were higher up,
I looked around here, and bingo.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:57.200
Now what are you doing here?

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.280
What's all that mountain udo?!

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:05.000
There's a ton! You love it, too?!

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.250
Love...

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:09.460
Nothing of the sort!
If you want it, I'll give it to you.

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.210
Really?!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.130
You're so nice!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:16.670
At any rate,
I'm glad you're safe.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.050
Come on, let's go back.

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.180
Okay.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:27.350
Maybe you're scared to climb down?

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:28.600
Of course not!

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.940
I'm not...

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:32.820
Ogata!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:11.650
B-Brother's rice bowl suddenly broke.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:16.650
Is it a sign that something bad
has happened to him?!

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.860
That's silly.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:21.910
I'm sure he's fine.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:32.550
THE NEXT DAY

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:35.540
WOMEN

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:47.680
W-Well, Ogata...

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:53.850
Cleaning the inn's bath as punishment for going
outside without permission isn't so bad, right?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.230
Yeah...

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.860
<i>This is too awkward!</i>

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.570
<i>Ever since yesterday...</i>

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.460
<i>W-Was that...</i>

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:18.050
<i>my first kiss? Or no? Which is it!</i>

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:18.050
OUT

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:18.050
SAFE

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:26.050
Um... Ogata?

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.260
Pardon me.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.060
Let's go back.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:33.230
Wait, Ogata! You're heading
away from the inn!

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:37.820
<i>She hasn't looked me
in the eye since then.</i>

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.690
<i>I guess she's angry?</i>

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.820
<i>I don't think it's my fault, though.</i>

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:46.240
<i>It was an accident.</i>

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.620
Anyway, sure is hot.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.040
Maybe I'll take my top off.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:09.260
Yay! I love taking baths!

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:12.100
I'm beat after studying all day!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.930
I finally get to swim!

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.030
Wh-Why are they here?!

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:28.200
Ogata, I gave you that
"cleaning in progress" sign to hang up, right?!

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:28.910
Y-Yes!

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.870
It's hanging right here!

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.080
It's supposed to hang at the entrance!

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.750
Your skin is so smooth!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.670
Don't touch me! That tickles!

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:48.590
Meanwhile, the situation is getting
more serious by the moment.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.220
Wh-What should I do?!

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:55.520
I'll never get the recommendation
if I'm branded a peeping tom!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.310
The recommendation would be
the least of your worries.

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:00.730
Sorry.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.320
Anyway, get into the sauna!

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.070
I'll handle this!

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.370
Wow, Ogata, you're so cool!

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.080
Huh? Ri.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.960
What's up? You look so serious.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.290
<i>I'm counting on you, Ogata.</i>

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:23.420
<i>If you honestly explain the situation
and the girls leave for a bit,</i>

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.260
<i>there should be no problem!</i>

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.090
E-Everyone!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:30.090
The sauna is really hot,
so you can't go in there!

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:33.100
<i>Huh?
Ogata, are you panicking?!</i>

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:35.310
<i>That doesn't solve anything!</i>

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:39.560
That aside, Rizurin, why are you
wearing your clothes in here?

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.360
Come on, strip!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.020
We're all girls here!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.990
Takemoto!
P-Please, stop!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:53.830
Huge...

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:58.040
<i>Yuiga is right over there!</i>

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.540
Well, where should we start?

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.880
Sekijo, please cover yourself!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.130
Why? What's the difference?

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.460
It makes all the difference!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.630
I love saunas!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.090
Should we go in, Fuminocchi?

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:11.930
Yeah!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.140
I told you it was too hot to go in!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:17.770
Did you say that?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.730
I'm up for that challenge!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:24.150
A sauna has to be hot!

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:31.200
It really is hot!

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:34.330
All right, let's see
who can last the longest, Fuminocchi!

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.330
I won't lose!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.210
<i>Wh-What is this situation?!</i>

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.460
<i>If they find me, it's all over.</i>

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:48.130
<i>But my body can't take much more!</i>

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:53.340
<i>Ogata, please!
Get them out of here as soon as possible!</i>

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.930
<i>You're the only one I can count on!</i>

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:05.400
<i>Yuiga is under us.
And I'm over him... in the nude...</i>

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.770
MIND IS BLANK

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.730
<i>Ogata!</i>

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.320
I've hit my limit!

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:15.820
You win!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.200
Water!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:21.410
<i>Yes! Now, if Furuhashi
would just leave...</i>

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:25.420
U-Um... Why don't we get out, too?

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:27.380
Ri...

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.340
The battle has just begun!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.300
I can easily last another ten minutes!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.340
<i>What's with the determination?</i>

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:36.350
Don't mind me. You can go, Ri.

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:38.260
That's okay, um...

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.100
<i>I-I'm seriously at my limit.</i>

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:45.150
<i>Ten more minutes and I'll be dead!</i>

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.110
<i>Crap!</i>

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.820
Huh?
Something under the bench...

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:57.910
<i>I'm doomed!</i>

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.910
Hey, you guys, listen to this!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:04.250
Apparently you can see
a meteor shower from the open-air bath!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.540
A meteor shower?!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.500
I want to see it! Let's go, Ri!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.710
Wait, Fumino... H-Hold on!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:16.760
You're under there, aren't you, Nariyuki Yuiga?

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:18.640
You really are there.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.100
S-Sekijo, there's a reasonable
explanation for this!

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:29.190
Save it.
I've pretty much figured it out.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.360
Don't look at me.

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.820
Sorry!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:37.990
Rizu Ogata was acting strange,
so I looked around,

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:42.540
and found your jersey
along with cleaning supplies.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.420
Sheesh.
You owe me big for this.

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.500
I'm in your debt, Sekijo!

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.340
Where's the meteor shower?

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:55.590
I can't see any!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.090
<i>I-I made it!</i>

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.010
<i>It's wonderful to be alive—</i>

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.360
T-Takemoto...

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:20.240
<i>It's over!</i>

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:33.920
<i>Did... Did I really make it?</i>

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:38.300
<i>I even had a hallucination
of Nariyuki here?!</i>

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:41.680
How hung up am I on him?!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:49.060
Cut it out. The water
should reach your shoulders.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:54.150
Oh, I don't need to set out
Brother's futon for tonight, right?

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:03.740
Brother's scent...

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:05.490
Sis, the tub's open!

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.880
Nari, where have you been
the past couple days?

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:18.670
Oh, I...

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:22.600
Hey, want to try
peeking in the girls' bath?

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.890
Hard pass.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.390
Why, Yuiga?!

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:29.270
Kobayashi, you'll go with me,
right? Kobayashi?

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.730
Vending Machines

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:34.270
Um, I apologize for what happened
yesterday and today.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:38.900
I already gave Sekijo
a coupon for Ogata Udon...

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:43.410
It sure has been an eventful two days.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:46.200
At least we both came out of it
no worse for the wear.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.660
Y-Yes. That's true...

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:56.130
U-Um... about yesterday...

00:19:56.380 --> 00:20:00.170
The physical phenomenon
may have been... that, but...

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:06.310
It wasn't.
It was just accidental contact.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.720
Right?

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.350
A-Absolutely!

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.520
It definitely wasn't that!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:16.440
O-Of course not!
It's like comparing apples and oranges!

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:21.150
<i>Well, one false step
and my life would've been over.</i>

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:25.530
<i>But thanks to that,
we can talk face to face again.</i>

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.540
<i>So I guess it's all good.</i>

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.200
By the way, Yuiga...

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.910
Did you see anything?

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.420
You did, didn't you?

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.550
N-No, I didn't!
My glasses were fogged up with steam...

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:42.880
Everything was blurry!

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.550
So you saw, blurrily?

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:48.970
Don't look at me like that!

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:36.830
How are those three doing...
Yuiga?

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:38.120
W-Well...

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:41.340
Their grades for their respective
weak points are improving,

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:43.250
so I think they're doing well...

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:47.510
Yes, their midterm exam grades
have shown improvement.

00:22:49.390 --> 00:22:51.470
<i>Ms. Kirisu was...</i>

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:54.390
Your first tutor?

00:22:54.390 --> 00:23:01.310
Yes. I think she wants
to meet you to talk about us.

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:02.520
What's she like?

00:23:06.740 --> 00:23:10.610
She's very... cold.

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:16.910
You took on a big responsibility
and are working hard at it.

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:20.370
Y-Yes!
I'm doing the best I can!

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:23.750
I see. The best you can.

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:26.510
Reprehensible.

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:31.260
Was kissing Ogata on the mountain
part of "doing your best"?

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:39.390
<i>Next time: Thus, X Geniuses Never Learn.</i>

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:40.060
NEXT EPISODE:
THUS, X GENIUSES
NEVER LEARN
